00:24:42.595 --> 00:24:43.958
Next up is Nora.

00:24:43.958 --> 00:24:45.232
"Thank you, Evan, for the shout out,

00:24:45.232 --> 00:24:46.068
"I really appreciate it.

00:24:46.068 --> 00:24:46.901
"I'm reading your book,

00:24:46.901 --> 00:24:48.499
"still trying to figure out my one word.

00:24:48.499 --> 00:24:50.758
"I am between two, explore, and create,

00:24:50.758 --> 00:24:52.940
"and it's hard to find a common
word connecting them both.

00:24:52.940 --> 00:24:55.296
"Any advice would be
greatly appreciated.".

00:24:55.296 --> 00:24:57.195
This actually is common

00:24:57.195 --> 00:24:58.569
when people have multiple words

00:24:58.569 --> 00:24:59.402
and they're trying to figure out

00:24:59.402 --> 00:25:02.175
how do I get it down to one?

00:25:02.175 --> 00:25:03.423
I get that there's a,

00:25:03.423 --> 00:25:05.523
you want to get it, you want
the sense of accomplishment,

00:25:05.523 --> 00:25:08.150
you want to rush to it and say,
here it is, here's my goal,

00:25:08.150 --> 00:25:09.002
I got it!

00:25:09.002 --> 00:25:09.835
You know, I accomplished it.

00:25:09.835 --> 00:25:12.139
As entrepreneurs, we are go-getters.

00:25:12.139 --> 00:25:14.766
I really encourage you to take
your time to figure it out.

00:25:14.766 --> 00:25:16.258
This is one of the most
important exercises

00:25:16.258 --> 00:25:17.513
you're ever going to do in your life.

00:25:17.513 --> 00:25:19.321
In my opinion, understanding yourself,

00:25:19.321 --> 00:25:20.344
having that self-awareness,

00:25:20.344 --> 00:25:22.788
and then building an entire
life and business around it.

00:25:22.788 --> 00:25:24.687
It's important to spend
the time to make sure

00:25:24.687 --> 00:25:26.461
you get it done properly.

00:25:26.461 --> 00:25:28.161
I know that may be hard to hear for us

00:25:28.161 --> 00:25:32.289
out and about go-getters,
but it's also important

00:25:32.289 --> 00:25:34.583
to make sure that you have the right one.

00:25:34.583 --> 00:25:36.045
So, when going through this exercise,

00:25:36.045 --> 00:25:37.966
I encourage people to look at two things.

00:25:37.966 --> 00:25:41.432
The first is, see if one
fits under the other.

00:25:41.432 --> 00:25:43.114
So, you have create and explore.

00:25:43.114 --> 00:25:44.684
I talked about having the one word

00:25:44.684 --> 00:25:46.041
and then the credo underneath.

00:25:46.041 --> 00:25:47.087
The credo is the three things

00:25:47.087 --> 00:25:49.082
that help define your one word.

00:25:49.082 --> 00:25:51.505
Believe equals passion,
equals self-confidence,

00:25:51.505 --> 00:25:52.788
equals conviction.

00:25:52.788 --> 00:25:54.239
That's what it means to me.

00:25:54.239 --> 00:25:56.278
Does one fit under the other?

00:25:56.278 --> 00:25:58.907
So, you have explore and create.

00:25:58.907 --> 00:26:00.777
Could explore be your one word,

00:26:00.777 --> 00:26:03.169
and create is under it,

00:26:03.169 --> 00:26:06.222
and you have two others
that are under explore.

00:26:06.222 --> 00:26:09.023
Or, could create be your one word

00:26:09.023 --> 00:26:10.601
and explore is under it,

00:26:10.601 --> 00:26:12.680
and you have two more next to explore.

00:26:12.680 --> 00:26:14.612
Are they equal level of importance,

00:26:14.612 --> 00:26:17.235
or can one fit under the other?

00:26:17.235 --> 00:26:18.892
It's a really important question

00:26:18.892 --> 00:26:20.921
because once you start
adding some definition to it,

00:26:20.921 --> 00:26:24.639
you can often realize that
this one helps me define

00:26:24.639 --> 00:26:26.031
the other one, and the other one

00:26:26.031 --> 00:26:27.697
is actually the most important.

00:26:27.697 --> 00:26:30.320
If they are equal importance to you,

00:26:30.320 --> 00:26:33.074
then I'd be looking at, okay,
what is one thing above it?

00:26:33.074 --> 00:26:35.570
Right, I use the example
in my book of my father,

00:26:35.570 --> 00:26:36.898
who was going through.

00:26:36.898 --> 00:26:40.062
He had heart, was his one
word, but he didn't know it.

00:26:40.062 --> 00:26:41.870
He ended up with, he started with

00:26:41.870 --> 00:26:44.025
he loves, he cares about people.

00:26:44.025 --> 00:26:46.057
Massively cares, he's
just a genuine human being

00:26:46.057 --> 00:26:47.890
and doesn't like to see suffering,

00:26:47.890 --> 00:26:49.462
and he loves adventure.

00:26:49.462 --> 00:26:52.952
Motorcycles, and zip-lining,
and fun adventures.

00:26:52.952 --> 00:26:55.248
So, how do those, those
seem totally opposite.

00:26:55.248 --> 00:26:57.285
I mean, at least create and
explore are kind of close.

00:26:57.285 --> 00:26:59.752
His seemed totally opposite.

00:26:59.752 --> 00:27:03.449
Caring and adventure
seemed totally opposite,

00:27:03.449 --> 00:27:05.403
and what came down to was heart.

00:27:05.403 --> 00:27:06.236
Heart is both.

00:27:06.236 --> 00:27:07.069
Heart is caring for people,

00:27:07.069 --> 00:27:10.276
and heart is going off and
doing something adventurous,

00:27:10.276 --> 00:27:11.977
your heart gets pumping,

00:27:11.977 --> 00:27:13.162
and so that worked out for him.

00:27:13.162 --> 00:27:16.348
So, that's a little creative
way to figure it out.

00:27:16.348 --> 00:27:19.751
Is there something that can
connect create and explore?

00:27:19.751 --> 00:27:22.358
At the surface, it feels
like the first one,

00:27:22.358 --> 00:27:24.160
where one fits under the other,

00:27:24.160 --> 00:27:26.007
but at the end of the day,

00:27:26.007 --> 00:27:27.357
this is your one word.

00:27:27.357 --> 00:27:28.549
This is who you are.

00:27:28.549 --> 00:27:30.916
It has to be something that you love,

00:27:30.916 --> 00:27:32.385
and the more you sleep on it,

00:27:32.385 --> 00:27:33.972
and the more you think about it,

00:27:33.972 --> 00:27:36.007
it'll either become more and more right

00:27:36.007 --> 00:27:37.855
or more and more wrong.

00:27:37.855 --> 00:27:40.220
If you doubt it more, and
more, and more, and more,

00:27:40.220 --> 00:27:41.444
then it's wrong.

00:27:41.444 --> 00:27:43.217
If you like it more, and
more, and more, and more,

00:27:43.217 --> 00:27:44.607
then it's right.

00:27:44.607 --> 00:27:46.631
And so with time, it'll add more clarity.

